ans took to the streets against  israel's provocations in jerusalem  and its assault on gaza on friday alone  10 palestinian protesters were killed  into clashes  with israeli soldiers it's hard to  imagine there's a potentially more  serious crisis unfolding in the  background of  all this unrest but across israel in  mixed arab and jewish cities  there's been several nights of horrific  communal violence  with the israeli-palestinian peace  process virtually non-existence  and this violence seeming to just spiral  out of control  the concern now is this could all lead  to an intifada  or palestinian uprising which could open  up a very dark  new chapter in this already long long  conflict  dana mts thank you
 

